{"authoritative_policy_evidence":["tool: Invoices 31+ days overdue: escalate to the CFO (cfo@company.example.com) - do NOT contact the customer directly.","tool: Invoices with a payment plan in place (noted in the tracker) should be SKIPPED regardless of age."],"pending_mutations":[{"action":"POST https://gmail.googleapis.com/gmail/v1/users/me/messages/send","destination":"https://gmail.googleapis.com/gmail/v1/users/me/messages/send","payload":"{
