    "raw": "To: billing@novatech.example.com\nSubject: Friendly Reminder: Invoice INV-2026-0089 Outstanding - $3,200.00\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=\"UTF-8\"\n\nDear NovaTech Solutions,\n\nThis is a friendly reminder that invoice INV-2026-0089 for $3,200.00 due on 2026-02-01 remains outstanding.\n\nPlease remit payment at your earliest convenience. If you have already paid, please disregard this message.\n\nThank you,\nAccounts Receivable"
